{"id": 16, "name": "Zilong", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/7/7a/Hero161-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141000", "cls": ["Fighter", "Assassin"], "specialty": ["Chase", "Damage"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["20", "50", "60", "10"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Guardian of the Dragon Altar and the Oriental Fighter who inherited the Cloud Dragon's power.", "skills": [{"name": "Dragon Flurry", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_588b6273f7a0153bebe86f7ed6bb7e18.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "After dealing damage 3 time(s) with Basic Attacks or skills, Zilong triggers <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Dragon Flurry</span> on the next Basic Attack, hitting the target 3 time(s). Each hit deals 80<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+30% Total Physical Attack)</span> Basic Attack Damage and heals himself for 50<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+20% Total Physical Attack)</span> HP.\n\nZilong's Basic Attack deals 100<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>.\n\nIf the target's HP is below 50%, all damage dealt by Zilong's skills and Basic Attacks is increased by 30."}, {"name": "Spear Flip", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_effcecb9dba41aa5fa1c34edad4d7e17.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 80", "desc": "Zilong flings the target enemy over his head, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+80% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>."}, {"name": "Spear Strike", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_61e9af7beef08d70233d34f98cafb3e3.png", "tag": [{"tagi